{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "gymbro-mcp-collection",
    "name": "GymBro MCP",
    "description": "Colección del sidecar **mcp** (`:3011`), no de Nest ni de chat-api.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Importá esta colección **y** `GymBro.api.postman_collection.json` + `GymBro.local.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Environment **GymBro Local** (el `accessToken` lo llena el Login Staff de la colección API).\n3. `mcpUrl` default: `http://localhost:3011`.\n\nSin Bearer: 401 en `/mcp`. Health es público.\n\nTools (`search_members`, etc.): usá `cd mcp; $env:ACCESS_TOKEN='…'; npm run smoke`. Initialize acá sirve para ver sesión MCP; el smoke cubre tools/list + una tool.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.environment.get('mcpUrl') && !pm.collectionVariables.get('mcpUrl')) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('mcpUrl', 'http://localhost:3011');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "mcpUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3011"
    },
    {
      "key": "mcpSessionId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "GET health",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('status ok', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('ok'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{mcpUrl}}/health"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "POST mcp initialize",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const sid = pm.response.headers.get('mcp-session-id');",
              "if (sid) { pm.collectionVariables.set('mcpSessionId', sid); }",
              "pm.test('jsonrpc result', () => {",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(body.result || body.jsonrpc).to.be.ok;",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json, text/event-stream" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"method\": \"initialize\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"protocolVersion\": \"2025-03-26\",\n    \"capabilities\": {},\n    \"clientInfo\": { \"name\": \"postman\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\" }\n  }\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{mcpUrl}}/mcp"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "POST mcp without Bearer",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"method\": \"initialize\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"protocolVersion\": \"2025-03-26\",\n    \"capabilities\": {},\n    \"clientInfo\": { \"name\": \"postman\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\" }\n  }\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{mcpUrl}}/mcp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
